      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 1 Broadfield Glen to the market—an exceptional four-bedroom detached family home, presented in immaculate turnkey condition and ideally positioned within the highly sought-after, family-friendly Broadfield development in Rathcoole.\nExtending to approximately 172 sq.m over three spacious floors, this beautifully appointed home offers bright, generously proportioned accommodation designed with modern family living in mind.\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, a stunning light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and family area, separate utility room and a cosy lounge, providing the perfect balance of open-plan entertaining space and comfortable everyday living. The first-floor hosts three spacious double bedrooms, including one with a stylish ensuite, along with a contemporary family bathroom finished to a high standard. The entire top floor is a superb principal suite, complete with a luxurious ensuite bathroom and an impressive walk-in wardrobe, creating a peaceful and private retreat.\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. The generous north-westerly facing corner rear garden has been professionally landscaped to provide an exceptional outdoor space, perfect for al fresco dining, entertaining, or simply unwinding. A standout feature of this home is its remarkable privacy, with No. 1 enjoying a unique position that is not overlooked from any direction. To the front, a private driveway offers convenient off-street parking.\nCombining generous proportions, a superb family-friendly layout, high-quality finishes and an enviable corner setting, No. 1 Broadfield Glen represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly outstanding home in one of Rathcoole's most desirable residential developments.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange your viewing.\n\nDetails\n-4 bed\n-4 bath\n-172sqm\n-Detached\n-A Energy Rating / Green Mortgage Potential\n-Generous corner rear garden\n-Not overlooked from any direction\n-Gas fired central heating\n-New windows/doors\n-Private driveway to front\n-Presented in turnkey condition\n-Open plan kitchen/dining/living space\n-Highly desirable residential location\n-Close to local shops, schools & amenities\n-Excellent transport links nearby\n-Ideal family home\n-Early viewing is highly advised!\n\nBER\nBER: A\nDirections\nEircode: D24 EDK4"
      },
